WEBVTT

00:00.694 --> 00:15.974
This's Hobby home made an amateur subbed
Share Free and nonprofit for friends as love anime

00:11.494 --> 00:15.974
<i>A lifetime of love</i>

00:43.054 --> 00:44.214
Welcome !

00:44.514 --> 00:47.554
I'm sorry for make you all come so far.

00:47.764 --> 00:49.724
There's nothing, right?

00:49.784 --> 00:51.514
Of course, no problem.

00:51.514 --> 00:53.564
It's a peaceful place.

00:53.564 --> 00:55.394
Make yourself at home.

00:55.394 --> 00:57.064
Thank you very much.

00:57.064 --> 00:58.194
Sorry to bother you.

00:58.614 --> 01:00.024
Where's the grandmother?

01:00.024 --> 01:02.574
She fell asleep a few moments ago.

01:02.574 --> 01:05.574
I don't think she wake until the afternoon.

01:06.224 --> 01:07.834
We are on the middle July.

01:07.964 --> 01:09.974
After we're finishing the examination.

01:10.554 --> 01:13.584
We went to stay at the house of Ririna's grandmother.

01:14.084 --> 01:16.584
There're many vegetables and a quiet place.

01:17.254 --> 01:22.464
A different environment made
 me feel like a new person.

01:25.514 --> 01:27.224
A test of courage ?

01:27.474 --> 01:32.354
Yes. Here is a spot where ghosts can appear.

01:32.354 --> 01:33.604
It's the first time I hear it.

01:33.604 --> 01:36.354
What kind of ghost will appear? 
You said, I decided not to go.

01:36.354 --> 01:39.734
Do you have any requirements?
What does the ghost wish?

01:39.734 --> 01:43.614
For example, if I see it, I will die within three days.

01:43.614 --> 01:45.734
You interested the place strangely.

01:45.904 --> 01:47.654
Oh, have you ever seen it?

01:47.654 --> 01:48.864
No, I haven't.

01:48.934 --> 01:50.074
Ah, I see.

01:50.454 --> 01:58.874
At Showa's age, a woman jumped into the lake because she refused her partner marriage.

01:58.874 --> 02:05.214
After that, a voice is heard
saying, I want to fall in love.

02:05.214 --> 02:07.764
A spirit that remained after her death, huh?

02:07.764 --> 02:11.434
Riri-chan, at least call it remorse.

02:12.724 --> 02:20.484
So people will go there and put the edamame
 tied with red thread as tributes to the lake.

02:20.484 --> 02:21.444
How is it?

02:21.444 --> 02:23.734
Is there such a rule?

02:23.734 --> 02:28.364
This is the way I used to try when I was a
 kid with kids living in the neighborhood.

02:28.364 --> 02:31.664
I would love to try that. 
That sounds interesting.

02:31.664 --> 02:35.284
It was unexpected. Do you like scary things?

02:35.294 --> 02:40.794
I’m not crazy about it,
but sometimes I watched a horror show.

02:40.794 --> 02:42.624
Me too, Misaki.

02:42.634 --> 02:45.674
It’s just a walk on the camping day.

02:45.674 --> 02:48.424
How to talk about we go after dinner?

02:48.424 --> 02:50.224
That's good ! And you, Nisaka?

02:51.264 --> 02:52.634
Um. Okay.

02:53.974 --> 02:55.144
Okay, we decided!

02:57.224 --> 02:59.984
That seem like merrily.

03:00.444 --> 03:02.394
Grandma! Are you awake?

03:02.404 --> 03:05.364
Ririka-chan and her friends, huh?

03:05.364 --> 03:07.314
Welcome, they came!

03:07.344 --> 03:09.324
I'm Ririna. Grandma.

03:09.324 --> 03:10.744
Good afternoon.

03:10.744 --> 03:11.954
Sorry to bother you.

03:11.954 --> 03:13.614
Ah... Umm ...

03:13.624 --> 03:16.914
I'm fiance with Ririna by the government notice.
 My name is Nejima Yukari.

03:17.834 --> 03:20.534
So, Do you the one that to marry Ririka?

03:20.564 --> 03:22.334
I'm Ririna, grandma!

03:22.374 --> 03:24.544
Moreover, he's a partner from the government notice.

03:24.624 --> 03:27.634
Oh my, what's the difference
 with you married your partner?

03:28.134 --> 03:31.384
We still not at the point of getting married.

03:31.634 --> 03:33.684
The Government notice, huh?

03:34.054 --> 03:37.394
Now it's good, there's things like that.

03:45.654 --> 03:47.364
The tomatoes are delicious.

03:47.364 --> 03:49.864
Yes, the taste just picked is a clear distinction.

03:49.864 --> 03:50.784
Right ?

03:50.784 --> 03:53.364
This's the first time I eat something so delicious.

03:53.364 --> 03:54.824
I'm glad.

03:54.824 --> 03:57.204
Don't hesitate if you want to add.

03:57.204 --> 03:57.914
Yes!

03:58.794 --> 04:04.254
When I was young,
 I was very opposed to my marriage.

04:06.884 --> 04:13.054
At that time, I met your grandfather for the first time.

04:13.054 --> 04:14.844
On the day of the engagement.

04:14.844 --> 04:16.894
Why you gon' do like that?

04:16.894 --> 04:19.644
It's quite common.

04:19.644 --> 04:24.274
My parents decided to me marry
 someone with I don't meet with him before.

04:24.274 --> 04:25.994
This is too rashly.

04:26.134 --> 04:28.564
Especially with grandpa.

04:28.944 --> 04:33.994
He is quiet and few words.
 I don't understand what he's thinking.

04:33.994 --> 04:38.914
Why did he choose me ? I really don't understand.

04:38.914 --> 04:41.624
He wanted to marry me.

04:41.624 --> 04:46.584
Compared with that time, there are people
 who pick out the right ones for you now, right?

04:47.084 --> 04:49.334
It’s a good time to catch up.

04:49.964 --> 04:52.804
Um... Your husband, where's grandfather?

04:52.804 --> 04:54.594
He passed away 5 years ago.

04:55.224 --> 05:00.104
If only me could see the red thread of fate.

05:00.564 --> 05:06.064
Then I should have a red thread
 with grandfather's finger too.

05:10.984 --> 05:12.574
What's wrong, Yukari?

05:12.574 --> 05:14.654
No, nothing.

05:21.374 --> 05:23.294
It's full of bamboo forest behind the house.

05:23.294 --> 05:27.214
There's the direct route,
 so it will be easy for you to walk.

05:27.214 --> 05:29.124
You will uphill after you can see the lake.

05:29.374 --> 05:31.594
Note : Edamame <i>are a type of soybean</i>

05:29.374 --> 05:31.594
You put a " edamame " there and come back.

05:31.594 --> 05:32.294
Do you understand?

05:32.294 --> 05:32.654
Yeah!

05:32.964 --> 05:35.134
Well, let's go in pairs.

05:35.134 --> 05:37.134
First from me and Misaki.

05:37.134 --> 05:37.764
Let's go.

05:37.764 --> 05:38.344
Yeah!

05:39.014 --> 05:41.604
After 5 minutes you follow.

05:43.434 --> 05:44.894
Did you hear that?

05:52.194 --> 05:52.904
What is wrong?

05:54.034 --> 05:59.324
Hey, Nisaka, it's feel like that 
something to keep in sight us?

05:59.324 --> 06:00.914
Keep in sight?

06:14.594 --> 06:19.474
Hear your grandma's story
 makes me think a lot of things.

06:19.474 --> 06:20.644
That's true.

06:20.644 --> 06:23.894
She said thankful for the government notice.

06:23.894 --> 06:27.144
But what's the difference between
 the government notice and grandma's marriage?

06:27.684 --> 06:30.104
Example, Is there a basis Scientific theory?

06:30.104 --> 06:35.984
It's no different from the matchmaker
 thinks this pair is a great couple.

06:35.984 --> 06:41.204
At least me and Yukari don't feel
 anything from scientific knowledge.

06:41.574 --> 06:43.664
I don't think it is like that.

06:54.844 --> 06:59.174
We arrived at the lake. 
I didn't think it was close by.

07:02.434 --> 07:05.434
Maybe she wished for feelings of love
 to her jumping into the lake, huh?

07:06.014 --> 07:10.184
If she thinks again, maybe there's
 another way to reject it.

07:11.524 --> 07:15.194
It seems like we won't understand
 if we're not in the same boat as her.

07:24.454 --> 07:25.784
Let's go back?

07:25.784 --> 07:27.084
That's right

07:29.124 --> 07:32.044
What do you wanna do next
 when the Government notice?

07:33.374 --> 07:34.794
Jumping in the lake or something, huh?

07:34.794 --> 07:36.324
Ah, No, don't do that!

07:37.164 --> 07:38.674
I'm kidding.

07:38.674 --> 07:40.054
Huh ...

07:40.054 --> 07:41.594
I'm sorry.

07:42.884 --> 07:44.974
I'm not angry at you.

07:46.474 --> 07:48.604
What about you, Riri-chan?

07:48.604 --> 07:50.724
What do you think of Nejima-kun?

07:51.434 --> 07:53.984
I'd never have thought it.

07:54.644 --> 07:56.314
Definitely not !

08:07.494 --> 08:08.744
Nisaka, Hey!

08:09.294 --> 08:11.164
Do you believe in ghosts?

08:11.164 --> 08:12.504
I don't believe it.

08:12.504 --> 08:13.664
That is true.

08:14.544 --> 08:15.544
It is just...

08:17.384 --> 08:18.294
It is nothing.

08:18.294 --> 08:20.214
Eh, what? I am curious.

08:20.214 --> 08:22.214
Just, what?

08:22.724 --> 08:27.554
When I was a kid, I think I've seen it ...

08:27.554 --> 08:28.764
Saw ghosts?

08:29.014 --> 08:29.944
Yeah.

08:30.144 --> 08:32.274
I don't believe that, so I don't know.

08:32.914 --> 08:34.574
But sometimes ...

08:35.094 --> 08:39.024
Maybe it's scary because I don't like what I saw.

08:39.524 --> 08:41.784
That's very unexpected. It's cute.

08:41.784 --> 08:43.614
Cute?

08:43.614 --> 08:45.454
Tell me. Do you believe me?

08:45.454 --> 08:50.744
Although, you told me. you can see
 the ghost and it's not good for you.

08:50.744 --> 08:52.544
This... that's right.

08:53.454 --> 08:54.914
I'm happy.

08:54.914 --> 08:55.794
What's it ?

08:55.794 --> 09:02.004
I was just thinking, Nisaka would
 have said that to me in the past.

09:02.884 --> 09:04.014
What do you mean?

09:04.764 --> 09:06.514
I'm just saying that I'm happy.

09:09.934 --> 09:12.684
I heard a crunch just now.

09:12.684 --> 09:14.024
Yes, I heard too.

09:16.144 --> 09:17.354
Hey, What?

09:17.354 --> 09:18.444
Look over there !

09:18.444 --> 09:20.444
There's definitely "something" there!

09:20.444 --> 09:21.954
Nisaka, Ghost?

09:21.974 --> 09:23.284
No way! As you know!

09:23.284 --> 09:25.324
Don't push me, stupid.

09:25.324 --> 09:27.204
But, Nisaka, that's it.

09:30.914 --> 09:32.284
Flashlight, Flashlight !

09:37.464 --> 09:38.674
I’m home.

09:38.674 --> 09:40.214
Welcome home.

09:40.354 --> 09:43.844
Oh my! Ririna and Misaki-san come together?

09:43.844 --> 09:46.384
Yes, but no ghost appeared.

09:48.844 --> 09:50.554
Of course nothing.

09:50.554 --> 09:53.974
A woman who jumped into the lake was me.

09:56.274 --> 09:57.774
Grandma?!

09:59.694 --> 10:01.404
Mom, Did you know this?

10:02.694 --> 10:05.694
I wonder if there will be any something to appear.

10:05.694 --> 10:08.114
Huh! There's no such thing as that.

10:08.114 --> 10:12.124
Um... Is it true that you jumped into the lake?

10:12.124 --> 10:14.414
Yes, that's true.

10:14.414 --> 10:18.084
I don't want to marry grandfather.

10:18.084 --> 10:22.004
Because I fear. 
So, I ran away on our engagement day.

10:35.474 --> 10:38.894
I knew it! I can't marry you.

10:38.894 --> 10:39.644
Hey! Wait.

10:44.904 --> 10:47.324
I have nothing left except death.

10:47.324 --> 10:50.954
When I think so, I jump into the lake.

10:54.454 --> 10:56.494
Ah, I'm going to die!

10:56.494 --> 10:59.754
When I think so, I feel scared.

11:00.674 --> 11:03.044
Anyone, help me!

11:15.684 --> 11:17.684
You try to spend time together with me first.

11:17.684 --> 11:20.434
After that, If you still don't want to.

11:20.984 --> 11:23.944
You just kill me and die.

11:27.614 --> 11:30.744
After that, we started living together.

11:30.744 --> 11:33.954
We have children and grandchildren.

11:34.744 --> 11:38.794
But he's still so taciturn anyway.

11:39.334 --> 11:44.674
But, On the day he will leave, he wants to say this.

11:49.464 --> 11:51.094
Granny...

11:51.094 --> 11:52.724
I'm here!

11:54.344 --> 11:59.764
The first moment I saw you, I fell in love with you.

12:01.814 --> 12:04.264
Those were his last words.

12:04.584 --> 12:07.814
But I didn't answer him.

12:07.824 --> 12:11.944
So the next time I see him, I'm gonna tell him.

12:12.364 --> 12:15.114
" I love him too. "

12:15.534 --> 12:17.494
It's so romantic.

12:18.164 --> 12:19.534
Right, Misaki!

12:20.084 --> 12:21.334
That's right.

12:21.334 --> 12:24.464
Well, I guess it won't be long.

12:32.864 --> 12:34.094
Nejima-kun?
Yukari?

12:35.434 --> 12:37.894
Stop! Please stop it!

12:37.894 --> 12:40.644
Nejima thought it's a ghost.

12:40.704 --> 12:42.434
Suddenly it jumps towards him.

12:42.554 --> 12:45.234
And after that it's follow him until here.

12:46.024 --> 12:48.154
Save me!

12:48.734 --> 12:53.444
Wow, That was unbelievable. 
Haniwa interested in someone.

12:53.444 --> 12:54.534
Haniwa?

12:54.994 --> 12:58.074
It's a dog that Grandpa's favorite.

12:58.074 --> 13:00.034
It names is Haniwa.

13:00.324 --> 13:03.024
It's been 5 years since Grandpa died.

13:03.024 --> 13:06.714
Since that time it has been waiting
 for grandfather to return.

13:06.714 --> 13:07.794
5 years ago?

13:07.794 --> 13:12.304
But I can't believe that Haniwa, it was so happy.

13:12.804 --> 13:17.184
I'm glad that the boy is Ririka-chan's fiance.

13:17.184 --> 13:19.764
I'm Ririna, Grandma.

13:20.854 --> 13:23.854
Why? Why? Save me!

13:44.624 --> 13:46.834
They slept like a baby.

13:47.334 --> 13:51.134
The first moment I saw you,
 I fell in love with you, huh?

13:51.134 --> 13:55.094
It's wonderful to say such a
 sentence before you die.

13:55.764 --> 13:57.974
I don't know at all.

13:57.974 --> 13:59.014
Yes.

13:59.014 --> 14:01.474
This kind of life is so good.

14:02.474 --> 14:04.224
I wish he could have had it, too.

14:05.064 --> 14:07.394
Don't you want to be able to live on it?

14:08.194 --> 14:10.194
Yeah!

14:10.194 --> 14:11.564
I wish he can live up to it.

14:16.244 --> 14:18.284
I think I want to take a nap too.

14:18.284 --> 14:19.284
I see.

14:19.784 --> 14:20.704
Me too.

14:39.924 --> 14:44.614
<i>Feeling of love</i>

14:47.224 --> 14:50.484
Yoko-san, I have something to tell you.

14:50.484 --> 14:52.814
I ... I ...

14:54.024 --> 14:56.824
I ... I love you.

14:56.824 --> 14:59.074
I'm glad, you're fiance chosen by the government notice.

14:59.454 --> 15:02.284
I'm glad. Me too!

15:02.284 --> 15:04.124
I'm very happy!

15:04.124 --> 15:05.454
Hey, Nii-tan!

15:05.454 --> 15:08.704
Is there the lover receive from the government notice ?

15:09.254 --> 15:11.754
Will Kizuna get the government notice?

15:12.884 --> 15:14.714
Yes, you will.

15:14.714 --> 15:17.884
But It's not between lovers will receive.

15:17.884 --> 15:18.674
Really!

15:18.674 --> 15:21.174
Yes, Even if you have a lover now.

15:21.184 --> 15:24.614
Once you have received the government notice,
 you must marry that person.

15:24.644 --> 15:26.434
Yukari!

15:26.434 --> 15:27.724
W - What?

15:27.724 --> 15:30.644
Are you free next Wednesday?

15:30.644 --> 15:32.314
It's free, why?

15:32.314 --> 15:39.654
The children live nearby will to come
 over a Halloween party at our home.

15:39.694 --> 15:41.404
Could you help me?

15:41.454 --> 15:43.324
Why me?

15:43.324 --> 15:48.994
Oh, I see, I already invited Ririna-chan
 But, you will also invite that handsome guy.

15:49.334 --> 15:50.664
Nisaka?

15:50.664 --> 15:54.044
Well, I think it will be impossible.
 Nisaka, he is ...

15:54.754 --> 15:57.794
Isn't this a statue of gold Haniwa ?

15:57.804 --> 15:59.884
It's 4 times as expensive as that pricing.

15:59.884 --> 16:02.634
If you could just invite him to here. I'll buy it later.

16:03.474 --> 16:04.634
Nii ... saka!

16:04.644 --> 16:06.014
No way.

16:08.354 --> 16:11.524
It's a party for cute kids.

16:11.524 --> 16:12.454
Please!

16:12.544 --> 16:15.144
I don't have to take any part in this.

16:15.154 --> 16:18.904
Please! Please, I beg you, Nisaka!

16:21.534 --> 16:23.154
Then you make me laugh first.

16:23.154 --> 16:24.904
Laugh?

16:24.914 --> 16:27.494
If I laugh, I'll think again.

16:27.494 --> 16:29.334
Okay, I see.

16:32.734 --> 16:34.754
Clay statue Earthen !

16:37.174 --> 16:39.344
Haniwa warrior in keiko armor.

16:41.174 --> 16:42.514
Haniwa "Dancing People"

16:44.934 --> 16:47.144
Ah, alright. I will come.

16:47.144 --> 16:50.644
Eh, sure? Looks like you did not laugh one bit.

16:50.644 --> 16:55.644
But I see you doing all that, It makes me pathetic.

16:57.104 --> 16:58.604
Pathetic?

16:59.984 --> 17:02.074
Oh, you laughed now!

17:02.074 --> 17:06.654
But I didn't laugh at your jokes.

17:07.824 --> 17:08.914
Takasaki-san.

17:10.584 --> 17:11.874
Takasaki-san.

17:13.004 --> 17:14.204
Nejima-kun!

17:14.544 --> 17:17.834
Are you free next Wednesday?

17:17.834 --> 17:19.214
Next Wednesday?

17:19.214 --> 17:22.964
I'll have a Halloween party for my sister at my house.

17:22.964 --> 17:26.804
Ririna and Nisaka will come, so I invite you too.

17:28.304 --> 17:31.184
Then, Could I take my brother too?

17:31.184 --> 17:33.564
Um ... Takumi-kun, right?

17:33.564 --> 17:36.934
No, not Takumi, my youngest brother.

17:36.944 --> 17:40.024
It's okay. No problem. I always welcome.

17:40.024 --> 17:41.234
I'm glad.

17:41.234 --> 17:44.284
By the way, Everyone wants to
 costume at the party, right?

17:44.284 --> 17:45.784
Yes, the plan is like that.

17:45.784 --> 17:46.944
You too?

17:47.284 --> 17:47.994
Maybe.

17:49.114 --> 17:50.284
What would it be like?

17:51.744 --> 17:54.624
It is nothing special.

17:55.794 --> 17:57.974
What dress will you wear to the party?

17:57.974 --> 17:59.544
Ah! Um...

17:59.544 --> 18:06.714
Maybe I'll wear a costume that Saiki-san made before
when I went to play with Ayano and the others.

18:06.724 --> 18:07.924
I see.

18:07.934 --> 18:10.474
Maybe, Ririna will wear a costume as well.

18:10.474 --> 18:14.314
So, I'm looking forward to enjoying. See you later.

18:15.024 --> 18:16.474
I also look forward to enjoying.

18:21.314 --> 18:22.654
I'm home!

18:22.654 --> 18:24.484
I’m sorry to interrupt

18:25.624 --> 18:27.744
Oh! Ririna, you got here a quick.

18:28.244 --> 18:31.034
It's a supplementary class for
 the midterm exams this morning.

18:31.034 --> 18:33.744
I don't have to participate, so I came back early.

18:34.164 --> 18:35.204
Oh, I get it.

18:35.204 --> 18:37.204
Welcome, Nisaka-kun.

18:37.204 --> 18:39.044
Thanks for coming

18:39.624 --> 18:40.714
It's alright.

18:40.714 --> 18:42.514
I am also here.

18:42.524 --> 18:44.714
Come on, please sit here. Nisaka-kun

18:44.714 --> 18:46.054
It's okay. Thank you.

18:49.344 --> 18:52.974
Nisaka, Please have some orange juice.

18:57.724 --> 19:00.814
Oh my god, that's bad!
 Sorry, Nisaka-kun.

19:00.814 --> 19:02.404
No, I’m alright.

19:02.404 --> 19:03.734
Are you hurt?

19:03.734 --> 19:04.774
Yes.

19:04.774 --> 19:07.234
Nisaka, let me wash your clothes.

19:07.654 --> 19:09.364
In the meantime, you put on this first.

19:09.744 --> 19:11.244
I don't need it.

19:11.244 --> 19:13.954
Why? It really suits you.

19:13.954 --> 19:15.704
I told you I don't need it.

19:15.704 --> 19:16.704
Ah, thank you.

19:16.704 --> 19:17.994
Kizuna also uses it!

19:18.294 --> 19:19.164
Yukari.

19:19.914 --> 19:21.834
You'll dress up it too, right?

19:23.964 --> 19:25.174
Me too?

19:26.004 --> 19:28.004
Misaki too, right?

19:28.014 --> 19:29.264
She said so.

19:30.474 --> 19:33.744
You should look at the atmosphere and participate!

19:42.734 --> 19:44.404
It seems very normal.

19:44.404 --> 19:45.274
Normal ...

19:45.694 --> 19:46.734
Aren't you afraid?

19:46.734 --> 19:48.154
Not at all.

19:48.864 --> 19:50.034
Did you finish changing?

19:53.614 --> 19:55.624
Nisaka is so cool!

19:55.624 --> 19:56.914
Fantastic !

19:57.244 --> 19:58.744
I want to take off the clothes just now.

19:58.744 --> 20:01.544
It seems that you were a real vampire!

20:01.544 --> 20:02.584
That really suits you.

20:02.584 --> 20:06.464
Nisaka-kun, I'll wash your clothes. Could you bring it?

20:06.464 --> 20:07.754
Ah, yes.

20:15.054 --> 20:20.564
It turned out to be more embarrassing than I thought.

20:21.484 --> 20:23.564
That's true.

20:24.604 --> 20:25.944
Isn't it weird?

20:25.944 --> 20:28.064
It's not weird! It suits you fine.

20:31.534 --> 20:35.574
Well, I'll go invite Takenaka-san and the others.

20:35.574 --> 20:37.954
Please take care of the rest of the preparation.

20:37.954 --> 20:38.824
Yes.

20:40.544 --> 20:43.044
Did you buy this pumpkin?

20:43.044 --> 20:46.044
No, this is from the neighboring children's association.

20:47.924 --> 20:50.344
Riri-chan, are you a cat?

20:50.344 --> 20:53.304
Yes. My mom did it.

20:53.304 --> 20:54.634
and yours, Kizuna-chan?

20:54.634 --> 20:55.844
Wait!

20:58.084 --> 20:59.554
Here!

20:59.554 --> 21:02.064
Oh, The witch. Cute!

21:02.064 --> 21:03.124
Looks Good!

21:15.654 --> 21:17.034
What's wrong, Kizuna?

21:20.034 --> 21:23.544
Nii-tan, I want to feel of love !

21:25.624 --> 21:27.544
Love ? Do you mean having a boyfriend?

21:27.544 --> 21:28.544
Yes!

21:30.214 --> 21:31.464
What do you think?

21:31.464 --> 21:32.894
What do you mean?

21:33.174 --> 21:35.484
Why do you think that, Kizuna-chan?

21:35.554 --> 21:41.014
Previously, Nii-tan was so smiling after
 seeing Riri-tan dress up in a cat costume.

21:41.014 --> 21:44.814
Kizuna, I want someone to smile like that for me too.

21:44.814 --> 21:46.524
Ah, that ...

21:46.524 --> 21:49.154
I think you misunderstand, Kizuna-chan!

21:49.444 --> 21:53.654
He was smiling that because she is wearing a short skirt.

21:53.944 --> 21:55.654
After all, Nejima is a pervert.

21:55.654 --> 21:56.784
A pervert ?

21:56.784 --> 21:58.744
Is that also love?

21:58.744 --> 22:00.164
Some perspective, yes.

22:00.164 --> 22:02.744
What are you teaching her, Nisaka ?!

22:02.744 --> 22:06.004
You ever feel love or a pervert.

22:06.294 --> 22:07.254
How do you think?

22:08.714 --> 22:11.464
I'll tell you when you grow up.

22:11.464 --> 22:12.794
How many years?

22:13.254 --> 22:15.134
I guess at 44 years.

22:15.134 --> 22:17.844
How many nights will I have to sleep for that?

22:18.884 --> 22:21.484
I think you have to sleep for a long time.

22:21.584 --> 22:25.774
What is that? Anyway,
 Kizuna wants to feel of love!

22:25.774 --> 22:27.544
Tell me how to do it.

22:28.854 --> 22:30.524
How to do it?

22:31.534 --> 22:33.564
Oh! Surely that's Misaki!

22:33.574 --> 22:34.904
I will pick her up.

22:35.194 --> 22:36.344
Misaki!

22:36.494 --> 22:37.994
 Riri-chan?

22:36.624 --> 22:37.994
I've been waiting for you.

22:37.994 --> 22:40.704
Well, let's change clothes. I borrow Yukari's the room!

22:40.704 --> 22:42.494
 Ah, hold on Riri-chan!

22:40.704 --> 22:42.474
I'll take care of the rest!

22:53.364 --> 22:56.304
You have a beautiful figure, Misaki.

22:57.594 --> 22:58.514
Umm ...

22:59.264 --> 23:00.344
Thanks.

23:01.094 --> 23:02.844
Did I say something strange?

23:02.844 --> 23:04.264
Ah! No.

23:04.264 --> 23:05.784
It's just that.

23:05.784 --> 23:09.394
If you said it directly to me, I feel embarrassed.

23:10.104 --> 23:12.234
Sorry! I make a slip.

23:12.564 --> 23:14.694
No, It is okay.

23:28.754 --> 23:30.084
How do you feel?

23:31.334 --> 23:34.084
Um.. It suits you.

23:34.084 --> 23:35.674
Yeah, you're cute.

23:35.674 --> 23:37.924
You always said that.

23:38.214 --> 23:40.464
Oh, Is that so.

23:40.474 --> 23:42.174
Oh! I see.

23:42.514 --> 23:43.554
What's wrong?

23:44.184 --> 23:45.304
In fact...

23:46.894 --> 23:48.764
Hey, Kizuna-chan.

23:48.774 --> 23:50.854
Why do you want to feel about love?

23:52.734 --> 23:56.064
Because only now can you feel about love?

23:57.614 --> 24:01.574
It is true. I'm just already the government notice.

24:01.574 --> 24:05.074
But I remember program just started after 
graduating from elementary school, right?

24:05.454 --> 24:07.074
That's right.

24:07.074 --> 24:08.964
My parents are Yukari couples.

24:08.964 --> 24:12.964
I talked about this problem, It seems
 that nothing has changed to them.

24:14.044 --> 24:15.374
It's impossible to refuse it.

24:15.384 --> 24:20.924
Hey, Kezuna-chan, If you meet a partner
 from the government notice. Is it not a love?

24:20.924 --> 24:22.344
I don't know.

24:22.344 --> 24:25.724
But I don't want to wait government notice.

24:25.724 --> 24:27.554
I want to feel of love now!

24:29.064 --> 24:35.774
But Kizuna-chan, That love is 
sometimes made you feel sad.

24:36.484 --> 24:37.984
Sad?

24:39.114 --> 24:43.494
Your chest becomes hurts and feel bad.

24:43.494 --> 24:44.954
Is it hurts?

24:46.534 --> 24:47.734
It seems like it

24:47.744 --> 24:48.994
Why?

24:48.994 --> 24:53.874
Feeling of love it made you'll be happy, right?

24:56.464 --> 24:57.544
That's true.

24:57.544 --> 24:59.004
Really!

24:59.004 --> 25:00.344
Yeah, sure!

25:00.344 --> 25:01.504
I see.

25:01.764 --> 25:05.094
So. Kizuna, I want to feel love!

25:04.634 --> 25:05.924
<i>Sorry to bother.</i>

25:06.764 --> 25:10.554
Sister, I brought Itsuki after he finished costume.

25:11.944 --> 25:14.024
Ah, thanks, Takumi.

25:14.024 --> 25:16.144
It made me annoyed.

25:16.144 --> 25:18.154
Then, I'll go home now.

25:18.154 --> 25:20.654
Come on, Itsuki, introduce yourself.

25:21.904 --> 25:23.574
I'm Takasaki Itsuki!

25:23.574 --> 25:27.284
Thank you for inviting me today for Halloween event.

25:27.574 --> 25:29.324
Misaki's brother?

25:29.324 --> 25:30.784
Cute!

25:36.044 --> 25:37.414
What's wrong, Kizuna?

25:40.494 --> 25:45.304
Itsuki, Why don't you say hello to Kizuna-chan?
 she's the same age with you.

25:46.204 --> 25:47.834
Um..

25:48.094 --> 25:49.094
Kizuna-chan?

25:52.264 --> 25:55.104
Why are you running away, Kizuna?

25:55.104 --> 25:59.084
Because, my heart is thumping.

25:59.094 --> 26:01.984
It makes me feel sad and I don't want it!

26:05.364 --> 26:08.404
Of course the love also has moments of happiness.

26:08.934 --> 26:11.524
There is sadness, embarrass.

26:11.674 --> 26:16.044
There are a lot of feelings.
Even though it's not all good things, but ...

26:16.584 --> 26:20.794
Even so, it's something that cannot inevitable.

26:21.714 --> 26:25.304
It's something like the red thread of fate.

26:25.674 --> 26:28.094
Well, I don't know.

26:28.094 --> 26:30.934
Although they're not bound and will not unite.

26:30.934 --> 26:33.684
But at least we can still make it.

26:38.064 --> 26:39.444
Can I say it?

26:39.444 --> 26:40.114
Yeah!

26:41.444 --> 26:43.194
Trick or Treat!

26:47.574 --> 26:51.074
If you don't tell me your name,
I will make you for trouble.

26:56.624 --> 27:01.044
I'm Nejima Kizuna.

27:01.044 --> 27:03.424
Kizuna-chan.

27:04.544 --> 27:05.964
Happy Halloween!

27:06.964 --> 27:08.764
Happy Halloween!

27:17.434 --> 27:19.354
The first love, huh?
